id=fiio_m33_audiotrack_noretrack
name=FiiO M33 R2R A/V sync fix (AudioTrack no-retrack)
version=v1.3
versionCode=13
author=ryanmagoon
description=Patches the device's own libaudioclient.so (skip forced AudioTrack recreation on start), libfiioaudio.so (keep the processing ring buffers when parameters are unchanged; wait for the processing thread instead of dropping a buffer on sample-rate switches) and audio.primary.bengal.so (correct frame size in the presentation position). Ships no FiiO binaries.
updateJson=
